23
00:00:47,820 --> 00:00:48,780
less nonsense

24
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,020
Get them both over quickly

25
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:50,940
do you want to die

26
00:00:51,260 --> 00:00:52,500
It's not that I don't want to give it to you

27
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:54,900
Mainly, your gun is fake

28
00:00:56,690 --> 00:00:58,250
Risking my life is the real thing
